  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective for this research area
 
To enable the Solutions Hub to understand the current challenges and barriers that programme teams face when designing and delivering programmes, and how best to encourage programme teams to approach delivery from an outcomes perspective. The work will provide an update to the 2018 report on challenges of programme delivery.
 
Expected Output
 
A report (20-30 pages) that provides an assessment of the current approaches and challenges to programme teams in business case design and delivery.</narrative>
